  "content": "<h1>裝甲損傷指示器</h1><p>如同戰術遊戲般簡潔、平面的裝甲損傷指示器</p><h2>色彩配置</h2><div>\n    <img src=\"https://github.com/CaioFTNT/Armor-Damage-Indicator/raw/main/assets/GYR.png\" alt=\"綠黃紅\" height=\"150\">\n    <img src=\"https://github.com/CaioFTNT/Armor-Damage-Indicator/raw/main/assets/WR.png\" alt=\"白紅\" height=\"150\">\n    <img src=\"https://github.com/CaioFTNT/Armor-Damage-Indicator/raw/main/assets/TR.png\" alt=\"透明紅\" height=\"150\">\n</div><h2>功能特色</h2><ul>\n<li>在HUD上顯示當前裝甲耐久度</li>\n<li>多種色彩配置（綠-黃-紅、綠-紅、白-紅、透明-紅）</li>\n<li>極簡平面風格，靈感來自《PZ》和《逃離塔科夫》等戰術遊戲</li>\n<li>可自訂位置、尺寸和透明度</li>\n</ul><h2>螢幕截圖</h2><div>\n    <img src=\"https://github.com/CaioFTNT/Armor-Damage-Indicator/raw/main/assets/Screenshot1.png\" alt=\"截圖1\">\n</div><div>\n    <img src=\"https://github.com/CaioFTNT/Armor-Damage-Indicator/raw/main/assets/Screenshot2.png\" alt=\"截圖2\">\n</div><div>\n    <img src=\"https://github.com/CaioFTNT/Armor-Damage-Indicator/raw/main/assets/Screenshot3.png\" alt=\"截圖3\">\n</div>",
